id: pm-todos-ctue
title: Certify pm CLI 2026.9.10 and record the truthful update-coverage warning it introduces
description: "The devDependency pin advances from 2026.9.7 to 2026.9.10, the published npm latest. CI runs this pinned binary, so the pin is what determines which commands and behaviours the gates actually exercise. The upgrade surfaces one behaviour change in the deep package doctor: pm-cli 2026.9.8 fixed GH-1219 to report truthful package update coverage for skipped and failed checks, so a package installed from a local directory now yields a partial-coverage warning naming the skip reason instead of being silently counted as covered. The integration test asserted an empty warning list and therefore encoded the old under-reporting."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
