    assert_stdout_contains[1]: pass 203
    note: Full suite under CLI 2026.9.10; the count assertion fails if any test is filtered out or added without review
close_reason: "Pin advanced to 2026.9.10 and the full release gate passes: npm test 203 of 203, coverage, docstring, canonical-reader and packed acceptance, audit:prod, pack dry-run, changelog:check, verify:release-changelog-date and verify:release-publish-attestation. The packed acceptance receipts record host_version 2026.9.10 for both the npm and bun current scenarios and 2026.8.20 for both minimum scenarios. The single test change asserts the exact warning list [extension_update_health_partial_coverage:skipped_non_github:1] rather than merely tolerating warnings, so any other warning still fails the test."
body: ""
